  "scope": "Executed synthetic host exact-decimal numeric policies, prefix checks, complete value checks and multipleOf LCM; pristine/ON/OFF complete intermediate witnesses. NOT-INFERENCE. No GPU numerical continuation, memory fit, allocation cost or performance qualification.",
  "implementation": [
    "C17 ABI1 owns canonical decimal parsing/comparison, strongest bounds, exact long division/product, empty interval/grid refusal, integer multiple reduction, prefix interval intersection and positive-decimal LCM. Constructor ordering preserves interval validation before integer multiple normalization.",
    "Policies copy inputs and remain immutable. Runtime prefix limit4096 bytes and1024 integer shifts; complete/schema spans4096 bytes and exponent magnitude4096, internal8192-digit natural capacity. Default32000000 counted arithmetic/prefix work units explicitly refuse; no floating remainder or binary float divisibility.",
    "Paired allocator hooks or defaultmalloc/free; each call owns bounded scratch and retires on all paths. Refusal preserves output. The measured x86_64 policy is24680 bytes and workspace114856 bytes, copying only live digits. These are host ABI footprints, not actual GPU allocation/cost or a speedup.",
    "Four exact source-bound provider edits use JSON/span/exception glue only; JSON representability validation remains adapter-owned. Existing defaultON/OFF selection now binds15 owned files and numeric recipe. Direct reference compiles legacy numeric predicates too; original-weight reference build/link/continuation unqualified.",
    "Schema compiler,string/Unicode-DFA/regex,vocabulary trie/transition/mask-cache and provider snapshot marshalling remain transitional. Full grammar task and all6 open root tasks remain intact. No new inference thread, RNG, model/device/HTTP operation, ABI layout/persisted-state or DS4 RAM/SSD format change.",
    "No Python product/defaultCTest dependency. Developer thermal/evidence helpers are optional."
  ],
  "coverage": [
    "7413 independent fixed-point/integer value oracles,1600 integer-GCD LCM pairs, bound/multiple signs, integer factor reduction, negativezero/exponent equivalence,4096/4097 scalar boundary, copied policy and invalid ABI/hooks.",
    "All policy/workspace allocation refusals and numeric check/value/intersection failures remain leak-free and output-preserving. Work exhaustion at compile/check/LCM, insufficient output capacity and intersect input/output overlap refuse explicitly.",
    "49 admitted numeric policies/16954 complete prefix witnesses/539 JSON values/196 intersections match pristine Gufo and OFF. Corpus covers stronger inclusive/exclusive bounds,negative intervals,zero/empty grids,fractional integer multiples,tiny/large exponents,invalid values and schema-number representability refusal.",
    "All6 previous complete numerical/bias/full-vocabulary/history/distribution/byte-grammar witnesses keep their exact prior hashes;13700 full byte states/7089 full masks across20grammars/23texts remain unchanged.",
    "Final20Debug+20ASan/UBSan/LeakSanitizer+18sanitizer reference-project tests pass; final recipe rebuilds and2Debug+2sanitizer contract rechecks pass.36 public C++headers and strictC17 warning-as-error compile pass. Imports only stackprotector,malloc/free,memcmp/memcpy/memmove/memset; no thread/device/qsort symbol."
